[0m[0m
The [38;5;10ms == 0[0m early return, the [38;5;10mh /= 60.0f[0m scaling, and the [38;5;10mswitch[0m fallthrough-free arms map directly onto safe Rust; the raw pointers are converted to 3-element slices once at entry, so the body is safe code.[0m[0m
